{"version":1,"key":"card:228","content":{"id":228,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"3652741d-f18a-44f3-af1d-7fc003b76ad8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过下标去访问字符串中的字符，所以我们可以通过下面的方式遍历字符串"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"759ff9a0-0a9b-4b1f-829e-2052db624538","collabId":"9ceaf984-043a-4bfd-aaa7-e10201fabfc2","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const str = \"Hi 𠮷\";\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < str.length; i++) {\n  console.log(str[i]);\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"cc78a5dc-67e0-4109-ae7a-2aeb8fa750b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是因为 JavaScript 的编码方式为 UCS-2，它使用两个字节表示字符，对于 Unicode 码点在 UCS-2 能够表达的范围之外的字符，JavaScript 是不认识的，因此上述代码的运行结果为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6ce8af96-aaa9-44af-bdd7-1abbbe1a04d6","collabId":"de4a4fd4-7aa3-4c06-bbaa-5d8f90c6c6f7","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"H\ni\n\n�\n�"},{"type":"paragraph","collabId":"6f4e1822-16ec-49fc-b38f-94f538b7c77f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES6 中升级了对 Unicode 的支持，可以通过字符串内置的迭代器正确的访问到字符"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"93201362-0936-4dcd-b0dc-2b5919b0f830","collabId":"2a2f23b9-d645-44fc-af16-bb490cee0242","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const str = \"Hi 𠮷\";\n\nfor (let c of str) {\n  console.log(c);\n}"},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ea1518b1-fcc1-472c-992f-e41e7d7932cf","collabId":"9f5b0d7d-e9aa-4c84-a8ea-97fb54e7f65d","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"H\ni\n\n𠮷"}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690900388099,"updateTime":1791451470267,"linkedCards":[{"id":257,"target":{"key":"card:257","type":"card","id":257},"summary":"JavaScript 字符串内部使用 UTF-16 存储，即用 16 位的码元来表示字符。对于码点超出 BMP（U+FFFF）的字符，需要两个码元表示，也就是代理对。但早期的一批字符串 API（如 length 、下标访问、 charAt ...","tags":["JavaScript/编码","JavaScript/字符串"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791451470267}}